{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的高亮词串起来能看出想靠近、怕给对方负担、对方没有退开、盼望长久又害怕失去的连续变化；X的大块虽然完整，但不少内容是抽象的情绪概括。small：Y的小字更常补足人物关系、心理原因和具体情境，能挂住大字；X有些感受块会再次解释大字已经表达过的想靠近、想倾诉和不舍。core：Y更清楚地贯穿了亲密带来的幸福与害怕它不能持续的痛楚，虽然延伸出互相依靠的情节，但没有偏离核心。human：Y更符合日常说话习惯；X的“重新踏实而有边界”“暂时完整的落点”“不容易理顺的牵扯”等表达有明显的书面摘要腔和生硬搭配。fine：X的感受块更集中在观众的身体感受和亲密相处体验，Y有不少感受文字直接描写声部、旋律、颤音等音乐本身，削弱了对观众即时体验的刻画。load：Y的高亮短语虽然数量有时较多，但单块短、总字量少；X经常每屏出现三四个较长的大块，短屏也需要连续阅读不少文字。concise：两版都有大字与感受重复表达的问题；Y反复回到未来是否会失去，X反复回到想表达又收住，虽然各自有所推进，但重复与新增信息的差距不足以判胜。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "17e9bcf0-5be4-436f-bf2d-f7a72b35987e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T145353366211Z", "elapsed_seconds": 329.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T14:59:23.365693+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a718fb64a7f7b2b33c878ebbcf78676aa6a1d8a07426dde295079399a57cc927", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0